7-770e-4fbe-a77e-b55192769a39\">get in touch</a></u></strong> to talk it through with a member of the Green Street team.\n                              <br>\n                              <br>\n                              In the next couple of weeks, we will send more content that builds on what we covered in Dallas.</td>\n                              </tr>\n                              </tbody>\n                              </table>\n                              </td>\n                              </tr>\n                              </tbody>\n                              </table>\n                              <table role=\"presentation\" style=\"border: 0; width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; mso-table-lspace:0pt;mso-table-rspace:0pt;\">\n                              <tbody>\n                              <tr>\n                              <td style=\"mso-table-lspace:0pt;mso-table-rspace:0pt;\">\n                              <div style=\"margin-top:10px;margin-bottom:0px;margin-right:0px;margin-left:0px;text-align:center;word-break:break-word; border: 0; mso-border-alt: 0;\">\n                              <div style=\"width:auto;display: inline-block; border: 0; mso-border-alt: 0;\">\n                              <a href=\"https://greenstreetadvisors.my.salesforce.com/sfc/p/f4000003AzjR/a/Vy00000BwWfV/PEkcijfoOHAeqWVFnkjpYCLp0m_vQmUrKXd5Nw6KlOE\" target=\"_blank\" data-component-id=\"4a07cefd-d0b0-4fe5-9a73-92cbcbf058dc\" class=\"\" style=\"direction:ltr;display:block;text-align:center;margin:0;mso-padding-alt:0;text-decoration:none;font-family:'Arial','Helvetica','sans-serif';font-size:16px;line-height:1.5;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;padding-top:12px;padding-bottom:12px;padding-right:24px;padding-left:24px;color:#ffffff;border-width:1px;border-style:solid;border-color:#49b065;background-color:#49b065;text-underline-color:#49b065;border-radius:4px;\"> <!--[if mso]><i style=\"background-color:#49b065;text-underline-color:#49b065;letter-s